<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
  html { background: #ffffff; }
  body {
    width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
    background: #1C2833; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  *, *:before, *:after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  h1 { color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 28pt; margin: 0 0 20pt 0; }

  .summary-box {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    padding: 20pt; border-radius: 10pt;
    border: 1pt solid #F1C40F;
    text-align: center;
  }

  ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  li {
    color: #ECF0F1; font-size: 16pt; margin: 10pt 0;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  /* Explicitly clear margins */
  .check { color: #F1C40F; font-weight: bold; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>总结与启示</h1>
  <div class="summary-box">
    <ul>
      <li><span class="check">✓</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;建立系统的金融认知框架</li>
      <li><span class="check">✓</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;掌握理性投资的底层逻辑</li>
      <li><span class="check">✓</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;实现财富的保值与增值</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <p style="color: #7F8C8D; margin-top: 25pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 20pt;">感谢观看 · 秒懂金融</p>
</body>
</html>